<title>GERMANY: TABLE-BASF DETAILS Q2 RESULTS VS Q1.</title>
<headline>TABLE-BASF DETAILS Q2 RESULTS VS Q1.</headline>
<dateline>LUDWIGSHAFEN, Germany 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>German chemicals group BASF AG on Thursday provided the following data comparing results for the second quarter of 1997 with the first quarter. The results show an improvement in sales and earnings in the second quarter.</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>					  Q2		     Q1</p>
<p>    Group sales		     14,358	vs     13,439</p>
<p>    yr/yr change		    +15.5 pct   vs     +13.6 pct</p>
<p>    Group pretax profit	   1,295	 vs     1,163</p>
<p>    yr/yr change		    +7.6 pct    vs     +3.8 pct</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	1,337	 vs     1,160</p>
<p>    yr/yr change		    +5.0 pct    vs     +8.8 pct</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
